OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who flew with swans warns of
OL,4,Alead danger
OL,5,
OL,6,FA conservationist has welcomed new laws
OL,7,Fbanning the sale of lead ammunition as
OL,8,Fshe warns people are not aware of the
OL,9,Fscale of the problem affecting
OL,10,Fwildlife.
OL,12,FSacha Dench, who lives in Chagford,
OL,13,FDevon, is a member of the Lead
OL,14,FAmmunition Collective, which campaigned
OL,15,Fto end the sale of the toxic substance
OL,16,Fearning the group the RSPB Medal - the
OL,17,Fcharity's highest accolade.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
