OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who flew with swans warns of
OL,4,Alead danger
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlso known as "The Human Swan", she is
OL,7,Fbest known for flying a paramotor 4,300
OL,8,Fmiles (7000km) from Arctic Russia to
OL,9,Fthe UK tracking the migration of
OL,10,FBewick's swans.
OL,12,FThe Australian-born biologist said lead
OL,13,Fpoisoning was a significant threat to
OL,14,Fbirds across Europe and was one of the
OL,15,Fissues she explored in her 2019
OL,16,Fexpedition.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
